+| **CI/CD** | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | GitHub Actions workflows, Docker support |
+| **Innovation** | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | Gemini Carbon 4 Extended Thinking integration |
+| **Honesty** | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | Clearly labels impossible routes, no false promises |
